      "@type": ["Dataset", "ResearchObject"],
      "name": "FIESTA Scattering Bio — scattering transforms complement a plankton CNN",
      "description": "Stacks multi-scale Cross Scattering Transform features (Delouis et al. 2022, originally for astrophysics) on top of Decrop et al. 2025's EfficientNetV2-B0 phytoplankton CNN baseline via a class-weighted logistic-regression meta-classifier. Headline result: +8.4 percentage points rare-class mean recall at −0.72 percentage points overall top-1 cost (Decrop's exact val/test splits, 95 classes).",
